  "created_at": "2026-09-29",
  "note": [
    "A diagnostic set, not a frozen benchmark and not a claim about model quality. Each case is a",
    "situation a reviewer meets, the sources a run would hold in that situation, and the properties",
    "the harness must keep. `tests/integration/test_reviewer_diagnostics.py` reads this file and",
    "asserts them against the real facts view, the real context builder and the real retrieval",
    "filter; the `observed` block records what the offline run actually showed.",
    "A scripted model proves data, structure, limits and the saving path. It cannot prove that a",
    "model recognises a conflict on its own - that is the live half, and it is NOT_RUN."
